  "content": "\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"史诗战斗横幅\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/NbAJwj8RHg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/epicfight\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/curseforge.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n</center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n## Epic Fight\n\n<center><em>Epic Fight 为你的游戏体验增添了复杂的游戏机制与战斗风格。融合了少许魂系战斗元素与独特的动画处理技术，打破《我的世界》的传统框架，将你的游戏体验提升至全新境界，并带来沿途的精彩挑战。</em></center>\n\n**新机制：** 你将体验到截然不同的《我的世界》战斗方式，所有实体都拥有全新且充满挑战的战斗机制。Epic Fight 彻底重构了游戏，引入了来自 FromSoftware 著名作品《黑暗之魂》系列、《只狼：影逝二度》与《艾尔登法环》的魂系战斗体验。\n\n**难度：** Epic Fight 初看可能令人望而生畏，尤其是对于从未体验过魂系战斗挑战的玩家而言。然而，本作旨在适合所有玩家。我们确保了提供丰富的武器和技能选项，让每位玩家都能找到适合自己的玩法风格。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n## ✨ 特性\n\n- **魂系战斗** - 探索一个拥有全新实体行为、挑战与可制作物品的世界！\n- **技能系统** - 寻找、学习并精通酷炫的新能力，解锁对抗敌人的全新方式！\n- **新武器** - 制作功能强大的新武器，搭配不同的技能与玩法风格！\n- **高度可配置** - Epic Fight 提供了极致的自定义选项，尝试各种配置来打造符合你心意的游戏体验！\n- **多人联机** - 独自游玩或与好友同乐，组建队伍并肩探险！\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n## 📷 截图\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/ZZZZZZZZZ1.png\" alt=\"游戏截图\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/1827189298.png\" alt=\"游戏截图\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/207981072389172389.png\" alt=\"游戏截图\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n## 📥 安装\n\n**客户端与服务器均需安装！**\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n## ⚙️ 配置\n\n大多数选项可在游戏内直接修改——无需重启。打开 **模组列表 → Epic Fight → 配置**，或直接编辑 `.minecraft/config/epicfight-common.toml` 配置文件。\n\n> **提示：** 对配置文件的修改将在下次加载世界时生效。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n## ❤️ 致谢\n\n由 **Antikythera Studios** 精心制作。\n\n- **代码与美术** - Antikythera Studios 团队\n- **翻译贡献** - blade_master_x, nameed, smokingbastard, luke_nogami, xablauler, a_k1m0, requiem4, shape.nan, ig114514, andy852546, kevinl2000, icewolf8964, yesman_0, kilotheneko, banikula, majmun.boy 及众多其他合作者。\n\n喜欢这个模组吗？在仓库点个 ⭐ 并在 Modrinth / CurseForge 上推荐该模组，其帮助程度远超你的想象。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分割线\"></center>\n\n<center><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2724\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/support.png\" alt=\"支持与赞助\"></a></center>",
